{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"সাধারণ গণিত": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) ০.২ &times; ০.০৩ &times; ০.০০৪ = কত?", "option1": "ক) ০.০০০২৪", "option2": "খ) ০.০০০০০২৪", "option3": "গ) ০.০০০০২৪", "option4": "ঘ) কোনটিই নয়", "answer": "3", "exp": "সংখ্যাগুলো গুণ করে যত ঘর আগে দশমিক আছে তত ঘর আগে দশমিক দিতে হবে।"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) &radic;60 + &radic;15 - &radic;135 = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) &radic;3", "option4": "ঘ) &radic;60", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>&radic;60 + &radic;15 - &radic;135<br />= &radic;(4 &times; 15) + &radic;15 - &radic;(9 &times; 15)<br />= &radic;15 (&radic;4 + 1 - &radic;9)<br />= &radic;15 (2 + 1 - 3)<br />= &radic;15 &times; 0<br />= 0</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) 5/a + 10/(a + 1) = 0 হলে a এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -1/3", "option2": "খ) -(1/5)", "option3": "গ) -(1/4)", "option4": "ঘ) 1/5", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(5a + 5 + 10a)/{a(a + 1)} = 0<br />বা, 5a + 5 + 10a = 0<br />বা, 15a + 5 = 0<br />বা, 15a = -5<br />বা, &zwj;a = -5/15<br />বা, a = -1/3</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) দুইটি ক্রমিক পূর্ণসংখ্যা নির্ণয় কর, যার বর্গের অন্তর 47.", "option1": "ক) 21, 22", "option2": "খ) 22, 23", "option3": "গ) 23, 24", "option4": "ঘ) 24, 25", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>ধরি,<br />সংখ্যা দুটি, x ও (x + 1)<br />প্রশ্নমতে, <br />(x + 1)<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> = 47<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1 - x<sup>2</sup> = 47<br />বা, 2x + 1 = 47<br />বা, 2x = 46<br />বা, x = 46/2 <br />= 23<br />এবং অপর সংখ্যা (x + 1) = 23 + 1<br />= 24</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) 1/2 + 3/4 - 5/16 এর 4/25 = ?", "option1": "ক) 5/6", "option2": "খ) 6/5", "option3": "গ) -1/5", "option4": "ঘ) 22/20", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>1/2 + 3/4 - 5/16 এর 4/25<br />= 1/2 + 3/4 - 1/20<br />= (10 + 15 - 1)/20<br />= 24/20<br />= 6/5</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) a<sup>3</sup> + 1/27 কে উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ করলে পাওয়া যায়-", "option1": "ক) a + 1/2", "option2": "খ) a + 1/3", "option3": "গ) a + 3", "option4": "ঘ) a + 1/4", "answer": "2", "exp": "a<sup>3</sup> + 1/27<br /> a<sup>3</sup> + 1/3<sup>3</sup><br />= (a + 1/3) {a<sup>2</sup> - a . 1/3 + (1/3)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= (a + 1/3) (a<sup>2</sup> - a/3 + 1/9)"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) &radic;2 + &radic;3 এর বর্গ কত?", "option1": "ক) 5 + 2&radic;6", "option2": "খ) 4 + 2&radic;6", "option3": "গ) 3 + 2&radic;6", "option4": "ঘ) 2 + 2&radic;6", "answer": "1", "exp": "(&radic;2 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup><br />= (&radic;2)<sup>2</sup> + 2 . &radic;2 . &radic;3 + (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup><br />= 2 + 2&radic;6 + 3<br />= 5 + 2&radic;6"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) a<sup>4</sup> &divide; a<sup>6</sup> &times; a<sup>3</sup>এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) a<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) a<sup>3</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) ‍a", "answer": "4", "exp": "a<sup>4</sup>/a<sup>6</sup> &times; a<sup>3</sup><br />= 1/a<sup>2</sup> &times; a<sup>3</sup><br />= a"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 1 + 2/3 = কত?", "option1": "ক) 5/3", "option2": "খ) 4/3", "option3": "গ) 6/3", "option4": "ঘ) 1/3", "answer": "1", "exp": "1 + 2/3<br />= (3 + 2)/3<br />= 5/3"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x - y = 2 এবং xy = 24 হলে, x এর ধনাত্মক মান-", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(x + y)<sup>2</sup> = (x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 4xy<br />বা, (x + y)<sup>2</sup> = (2)<sup>2</sup> + 4.24<br />বা, (x + y)<sup>2</sup> = 4 + 96<br />বা, (x + y) = &plusmn; &radic;100<br />= &plusmn; 10</p>\r\n<p>ধনাত্মক মান নিয়ে<br />x + y = 10<br /><u>x - y = 2</u><br />2x = 12<br />বা, x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) ‍a + b + c = 0 হলে ‍a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 3abc", "option2": "খ) 3a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) 12abc", "option4": "ঘ) কোনটিই নয়", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>দেওয়া আছে, <br />a + b + c = 0<br />এখন, &zwj;a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup><br />= (a + b + c) (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca) + 3abc<br />= 0 + 3abc<br />= 3abc</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) 4ab এর সঠিক প্রয়োগ কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (a + b)<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) (a - b)<sup>2</sup> - (a + b)<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) (a + b)<sup>2</sup>/2 + (a + b)<sup>2</sup>/2", "option4": "ঘ) {(a + b)/2}<sup>2</sup> - {(a - b)/2}<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "1", "exp": "এইটা 4ab এর সূত্র।"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) যদি x = -1 হয় তাহলে -(x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> + x) = কত?", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) -4", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "3", "exp": "-(x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> + x)<br />= -{1 + 1 + (-1) + (-1)}<br />= -(2 - 2)<br />= 0"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) x<sup>2</sup> - 10xy - 11y<sup>2</sup> এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x - y) (x + 11y)", "option2": "খ) (x - 11y) (x + y)", "option3": "গ) (x + 11y) (x - y)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 5y) (x - 4y)", "answer": "2", "exp": "x<sup>2</sup> - 10xy - 11y<sup>2</sup><br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 11xy + xy - 11y<sup>2</sup><br />= x(x - 11y) + y(x - 11y)<br />= (x - 11y) (x + y)"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) যদি (x - y)<sup>2</sup> = 12 এবং xy = 2 হয়, তাহলে x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 12", "option2": "খ) 14", "option3": "গ) 18", "option4": "ঘ) 16", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>) = (x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 2xy<br />= 12 + (2.2)<br />= 12 + 4<br />= 16</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) 2x<sup>2</sup> - xy - 6y<sup>2</sup> এর উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) (2y + x)", "option2": "খ) (2x - 3y)", "option3": "গ) (2x + 3y)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 2y)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>2x<sup>2</sup> - xy - 6y<sup>2</sup><br />= 2x<sup>2</sup> - 4xy + 3xy - 6y<sup>2</sup><br />= 2x(x - 2y) + 3y(x - 2y)<br />= (x - 2y) (2x + 3y)</p>\r\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 17px; top: -9.52678px;\">\r\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) (a - b) = 3 এবং a + b = 7 হলে ab এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 16", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "ab = {(a + b)/2}<sup>2</sup> - {(a - b)/2}<sup>2</sup><br />= (7/2)<sup>2</sup> - (3/2)<sup>2</sup><br />= 49/4 - 9/4<br />= (49 - 9)/4<br />= 40/4<br />= 10"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) কোন বিন্দুর স্থানাঙ্ক (x, y) হলে, মূল বিন্দুর দূরত্ব কত?", "option1": "ক) &radic;(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)", "option2": "খ) x + y", "option3": "গ) &radic;(x + y)<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) &radic;(x<sup>2</sup>) + y<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "1", "exp": "মূল বিন্দুর স্থানাঙ্ক (0, 0)<br />একটি বিন্দু (x, y)<br />দুটি বিন্দুর মধ্যবর্তী দূরত্ব = &radic;{(x - x<sub>1</sub>)<sup>2</sup> + (y - y<sub>1</sub>)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= &radic;{(x - 0)<sup>2</sup> + (y - 0)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= &radic;(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) a = &radic;3 + &radic;2 হলে ‍a<sup>3</sup> + 3a + 3a<sup>-1</sup> + a<sup>-3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 8&radic;2", "option2": "খ) 16&radic;2", "option3": "গ) 18&radic;2", "option4": "ঘ) 24&radic;2", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>দেওয়া আছে, <br />&zwj; a = &radic;3 + &radic;2<br />&there4; 1/a = 1/(&radic;3 + &radic;2)<br />= (&radic;3 - &radic;2)/{(&radic;3 + &radic;2) (&radic;3 - &radic;2)}<br />= (&radic;3 - &radic;2)/{(&radic;3)<sup>2</sup> - (&radic;2)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= (&radic;3 - &radic;2)/(3 - 2)<br />= (&radic;3 - &radic;2)/1<br />= &radic;3 - &radic;2<br />প্রদত্ত রাশি,<br />&zwj;a<sup>3</sup> + 3a + 3a<sup>-1</sup> + a<sup>-3</sup><br />= a<sup>3</sup> + 1/a<sup>3</sup> + 3a + 3/a<br />= (a + 1/a)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- 3(a + 1/a) + 3(a + 1/a)<br />= (a + 1/a)<sup>3</sup><br />= (&radic;3 + &radic;2 + &radic;3 - &radic;2 )<sup>3</sup><br />= (2&radic;3)<sup>3</sup><br />= 24&radic;3</p>\r\n<p>প্রদত্ত অপশনে সঠিক উত্তর না থাকায় বাতিল করা হয়েছে।</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 2 এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) x + 2", "option2": "খ) x + 3", "option3": "গ) x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "x<sup>2</sup> - x - 2<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + x - 2<br />= x(x - 2) + 1(x - 2)<br />= (x - 2) (x + 1)"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) x<sup>2</sup> - &radic;5 x + 1 = 0 হলে x + 1/x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) &radic;5", "option2": "খ) &radic;2", "option3": "গ) &radic;3", "option4": "ঘ) &radic;15", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - &radic;5 x + 1<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = &radic;5 x<br />বা, (x<sup>2</sup> +1)/x = &radic;5<br />বা, x + 1/x = &radic;5</p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) 3x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> - 21x - 20 রাশিটির একটি উৎপাদক হচ্ছে-", "option1": "ক) x + 2", "option2": "খ) x - 2", "option3": "গ) x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) 3x<sup>2</sup> - 1 - x", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>3x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> - 21x - 20<br />= 3x<sup>3</sup> + 3x<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> - x - 20x - 20<br />= 3x<sup>2</sup>(x + 1) - x(x + 1) - 20(x + 1)<br />= (x + 1) (3x<sup>2</sup> - x - 20)</p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) x/y এর সাথে কত যোগ করলে যোগফল 2y/x হবে?", "option1": "ক) (2y<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "option2": "খ) (x<sup>2</sup> - 2y<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "option3": "গ) (x<sup>2</sup> + 2y<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "option4": "ঘ) (x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>2y/x - x/y<br />= (2y<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>)/xy</p>\r\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: -29px; top: -12px;\">\r\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) 36 - 12x + x<sup>2</sup> এর উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ কী?", "option1": "ক) (x - 3)", "option2": "খ) (x - 6)", "option3": "গ) (x - 6)<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) (x - 9)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>36 - 12x + x<sup>2</sup><br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 12x + 36<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 6x + 36<br />= x(x - 6) - 6(x - 6)<br />= (x - 6) (x - 6)<br />= (x - 6)<sup>2</sup></p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) (x - a)(x + b) = ?", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + (b - a) x - ab", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - (a - b) x - ab", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + (a + b) x - ab", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + (a - b) x + ab", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>(x - a)(x + b) = x(x + b) - a (x + b)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = x<sup>2</sup> + bx - ax - ab<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = x<sup>2</sup> + (b - a)x - ab<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= x<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)x &ndash; ab</p>\r\n<p>অপশন ক) ও খ) - উভয়ই উত্তর হয়, তাই বাতিল করা হয়েছে।</p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) x - 1/x = 5 হলে (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 29", "option2": "খ) 27", "option3": "গ) 25", "option4": "ঘ) 32", "answer": "1", "exp": "(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = (x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 4.x.1/x<br />= 5<sup>2</sup> + 4<br />= 25 + 4<br />= 29"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> - 2y - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক x + y + 1 হলে অপর উৎপাদকটি কি?", "option1": "ক) x + y - 1", "option2": "খ) x - y + 1", "option3": "গ) y - x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - y - 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> - 2y - 1<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y<sup>2</sup> + 2y + 1)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y<sup>2</sup> + 2.y.1 + 1<sup>2</sup>)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y + 1)<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + y + 1) (x - y - 1)"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) x<sup>3</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> কে x - 2 দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ কত?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) -6", "option4": "ঘ) -8", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x - 2)x<sup>3</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <u>x<sup>3</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup></u><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x<sup>2</sup><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<u>x<sup>2</sup> - 2x</u><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2x<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<u>2x - 4</u><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4 (ভাগশেষ)</p>"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) x = 1/2 হলে, (2x + 1) (4x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1) এর মান নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(2x + 1) (4x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1)<br />= (2.1/2 + 1) (4.1/4 + 2.1/2 + 1)<br />= (1 + 1) (1 + 1 + 1)<br />= (2) &times; (3)<br />= 6</p>"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) 2 &divide; 0.002 = ?", "option1": "ক) 200", "option2": "খ) 100", "option3": "গ) 1000", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>&nbsp;2 &divide; 0.002 = 1000</p>\r\n<p>বিপরীতক্রমে , 1000 &times; 0.002 = 2</p>"}, {"id": "31", "question": "৩১) p + 1/p = 2 হলে p<sup>2</sup> + 1/p<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>p<sup>2</sup> + 1/p<sup>2</sup> <br />= (p + 1/p)<sup>2</sup> - 2.p.1/p<br />= 2<sup>2</sup> - 2<br />= 4 - 2<br />= 2</p>"}, {"id": "32", "question": "৩২) a এর মান কত হলে 9x<sup>2</sup> - ax + 4 একটি পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে?", "option1": "ক) 9", "option2": "খ) 12", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>9x<sup>2</sup> - ax + 4<br />= (3x)<sup>2</sup> - 2.3x.2 + 2<sup>2</sup> + 2.3x.2 - ax<br />= (3x - 2)<sup>2</sup> + 12x - ax<br />রাশিটি পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে যদি,<br />12x - ax = 0<br />বা, &zwj;-ax = -12x<br />বা, a = 12</p>"}, {"id": "33", "question": "৩৩) 0.001/(0.01 &times 0.001) = কত?", "option1": "ক) 100", "option2": "খ) 1000", "option3": "গ) 0.1000", "option4": "ঘ) 10000", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>0.001/(0.01 &times; 0.001)</p>\r\n<p>= 0.001/0.00001</p>\r\n<p>= 100</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": "34", "question": "৩৪) a - [a - {a - (a + 1)}] এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) a + 1", "option4": "ঘ) a - 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a - [a - {a - (a + 1)}]<br />= a - [a - {a - a - 1}]<br />= a - [a + 1]<br />= a - a - 1<br />= -1</p>"}, {"id": "35", "question": "৩৫) x<sup>3</sup> - x এর উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) 